TITLE="'orders is down' — but it is running perfectly"
TIER=ns
CATEGORY=Basics
SOURCE=P17
BUDGET=4
EXAM=true
SYMPTOM="Production is returning 503 for the orders API. You run kubectl get
pods and orders is Running, 1/1, no restarts, and has been for an hour. The
deployment is healthy, the Service has a ClusterIP. Everything you look at is
fine, and the API is still down."
